xcal analysis 'big118': tau=1.01 eps_v=0.001; 2000 cluster-bootstrap resamples over load scenarios
calibration: c from ALL 100 load scenarios of calib_n1_base for every other set (cross-set); 5-fold grouped CV for calib_n1_base itself
rules: max = largest calibration score; conf<a> = split-conformal over load scenarios. Base-case policies use c measured against our own NR (stronger baseline).
Bounds: cp_hi = Clopper-Pearson two-sided 95% upper limit, cp_hi1 one-sided; load = fraction of LOAD SCENARIOS with >= 1 miss (cluster level).
Sets: calib N-1 (CV) = calib_n1_base (2200 scen, 100 load scen); S100 N-1 = stress100_n1_base (2200 scen, 100 load scen); S100 N-2 = stress100_n2_base (2199 scen, 100 load scen); S100 N-3 = stress100_n3_base (2199 scen, 100 load scen); S100 N-5 = stress100_n5_base (2194 scen, 100 load scen); paper N-1 = case118_ieee_base_seed0 (638 scen, 29 load scen)

==============================================================================================================
